.nh
.TH "GF-PROVISIONING-PUT-MUTE-TIMING" "1" "May 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
gf-provisioning-put-mute-timing - Replaces an existing mute timing


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf provisioning put-mute-timing [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Replaces an existing mute timing

.PP
Body schema (MuteTimeInterval):
  name                                 string
  time_intervals                       array
  time_intervals[].days_of_month       array
  time_intervals[].location            string
  time_intervals[].months              array
  time_intervals[].times               array
  time_intervals[].times[].end_time    string
  time_intervals[].times[].start_time  string
  time_intervals[].weekdays            array
  time_intervals[].years               array

.PP
Response schema (PutMuteTimingAccepted.Payload):
  name                                 string
  time_intervals                       array
  time_intervals[].days_of_month       array
  time_intervals[].location            string
  time_intervals[].months              array
  time_intervals[].times               array
  time_intervals[].times[].end_time    string
  time_intervals[].times[].start_time  string
  time_intervals[].weekdays            array
  time_intervals[].years               array


